CORE
main.c
--pointer-check --static-array --show-properties
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^Property read_dynamic.pointer_dereference.1:$
access is outside the static parameter minimum and is not otherwise valid
--
^Property read_known.pointer_dereference.
^Property read_dynamic.pointer_dereference.2:$
^warning: ignoring
--
Shows that --static-array combines dynamic coverage with the ordinary checks in
one residual property; fewer properties do not guarantee faster solving.
